# Cloudflare Pages caps a deployment at 20,000 files. Keep these in the repo but
# out of the deployed asset set so we stay under the limit. Everything here is
# either served from another project (the design-wiki sprites, redirected in
# _redirects to magepunk-sprites.pages.dev) or not fetched by the site at
# runtime (tests, docs, build tooling, plans, the unlinked scoundrel prototype).
node_modules
.git
designwiki/sprites
battlecards/tests
battlecards/docs
tools
Plans
scoundrel
